	measure 'plan - actual' = ```
			
			var day_act_notblank = DATEDIFF(MAX(Particulars[Plan]) , MAX(Particulars[Actual]), DAY)
			var day_act_isblank = DATEDIFF(MAX(Particulars[Plan]), TODAY(), DAY)
			var res = IF(MAX(Particulars[Plan]) > TODAY() && MAX(Particulars[Actual]) < MAX(Particulars[Plan]), 
			                blank(),
			                IF(NOT ISBLANK(MAX(Particulars[Actual])),
			                    day_act_notblank,
			                    day_act_isblank
			                )
			)
			return IF(NOT ISBLANK(MAX(Particulars[Actual])), BLANK(), res)
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: f69361a1-fdae-44e0-9732-66f317a9a8bd

